I’m going to make three scoped harness/config edits: enable the generator classes, make the DUT data-memory indexing subtract the Spike/linker base for data accesses, and teach the linker to keep riscv-dv `.region_*` data pages inside the loaded binary image. I’m also updating the gate metadata so the suite checks the J12 scope instead of the old arithmetic-only lock.
