codex
I’m applying the RTL fix by carrying the predicted target into IF/EX and including target equality in `ex_mispredict` for predicted-taken branch/JAL/JALR paths. Direction mismatch still works as before, and RAS keeps its existing MEM-stage target check.
apply patch
