codex
To keep J12 focused on load/store + branch/jump and respect “M/mul-div may stay as-is,” I’m switching this riscv-dv runner’s J12 generation ISA to RV32IC for now. That keeps compressed, load/store, and branch/jump enabled, while avoiding a separate M-unit debug wave.
